NAME
    udp - send or receive one UDP datagram

SYNOPSIS
    udp send ADDRESS PORT [TEXT...]
    udp recv PORT

DESCRIPTION
    Sends one checksummed datagram from a reported ephemeral port, using
    standard input when TEXT is omitted, or waits boundedly for one datagram on
    PORT. Use the reported source port to receive a reply. Receive output
    includes the peer and exact payload. DNS and general sockets are not part
    of this command.
